{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23152","headline":"初加朝散大夫又转上柱国 · 白居易","name":"初加朝散大夫又转上柱国","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫微今日烟霄地，赤岭前年泥土身。\n得水鱼还动鳞鬣，乘轩鹤亦长精神。\n且慙身忝官阶贵，未敢家嫌活计贫。\n柱国勳成私自问，有何功德及生人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23152.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23152","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}